.so fork.tmac
.PP
.pt_jd_parse_file
.RS 4
.PP
Builds a memory tree to reflect the contents of a JSON file.
Returns
.B true
for success and
.B false
for failure.
Upon failure,
.I pe
will contain the absolute file location of where the error was
detected and a description of the error.
.TP
.I fd
is an open file descriptor from which the file contents will be read.
.TP
.I node
is a pointer-to-pointer to which the constructed
.B jd_Node
tree will be written as the means by which the result is returned to
the calling function.
.TP
.I pe
is a simple struct that, upon a parsing error, returns the absolute
file position at which the error was detected, and a message
describing the error.
.RE
